WEBVTT

00:09.050 --> 00:10.844
Are we sure
the patient is doing okay?

00:10.927 --> 00:13.972
His BP is dropping again.
Hang on. Let me check.

01:01.144 --> 01:02.270
You should eat these.

01:04.731 --> 01:06.191
You need to eat well today.

01:06.816 --> 01:08.943
- Thank you. I will.
- You're welcome.

01:32.008 --> 01:35.678
Uh, excuse me, but the girl that was here.
Did you see where she went?

01:35.762 --> 01:37.472
Uh, she left a while ago.

01:37.555 --> 01:38.973
Do you know when?

01:39.557 --> 01:40.892
About ten minutes ago.

01:42.602 --> 01:43.478
Thank you.

02:48.293 --> 02:49.460
Excuse me.

02:50.795 --> 02:53.298
You are Hong Woo-jin's guardian, right?

02:54.007 --> 02:55.300
Uh, yes.

02:56.134 --> 02:57.760
The operation went well.

02:58.428 --> 03:02.265
We'll have to monitor his progress,
but the surgery was successful.

03:10.607 --> 03:12.150
God, thank you.

03:14.986 --> 03:16.070
Thank you so much.

03:20.033 --> 03:21.326
Hang in there.

03:21.409 --> 03:22.911
Yeah.

03:58.947 --> 04:02.325
BLOODHOUNDS

04:17.799 --> 04:20.760
MARINE SPIRIT!
KIM MYEONG-GIL

05:02.051 --> 05:03.803
Hey.

05:03.886 --> 05:05.596
Gets me every time.

05:07.140 --> 05:07.974
Let's go.

05:19.193 --> 05:20.653
Whoa!

05:25.325 --> 05:26.159
Let's run.

05:54.729 --> 05:55.855
Woo!

05:56.939 --> 05:57.899
Ah!

06:28.930 --> 06:30.056
- Eighty-six!
- Eighty-six!

06:31.057 --> 06:31.933
Eighty-eight!

06:32.016 --> 06:33.643
- Eighty-nine!
- Eighty-nine!

06:34.352 --> 06:35.603
- Ninety!
- Ten more!

06:36.229 --> 06:37.772
One!

06:37.855 --> 06:38.731
- Two!
- Two!

06:39.232 --> 06:40.400
- Three!
- Three!

06:42.985 --> 06:43.986
Twelve.

06:44.946 --> 06:46.072
Thirteen.

06:47.198 --> 06:48.866
Fourteen.

06:48.950 --> 06:50.159
Good morning, sir.

06:51.452 --> 06:53.579
Good morning, sir.

07:06.509 --> 07:07.343
Continue.

07:11.556 --> 07:12.473
Fifteen.

07:13.975 --> 07:14.976
Sixteen.

07:15.059 --> 07:17.145
One, two, three, four!

07:17.645 --> 07:19.730
One, two, three, four, five!

07:19.814 --> 07:21.732
One, two, three, four!

07:22.233 --> 07:23.985
One, two, three, four!

07:24.485 --> 07:25.903
One, two, three, four!

07:26.446 --> 07:27.989
One, two, three, four!

07:28.614 --> 07:30.533
One, two, three, four!

07:49.135 --> 07:50.595
You did it! Yes!

07:58.144 --> 08:00.146
- Whoa!
- Good job. Get up.

08:02.648 --> 08:05.234
What we want to do is topple them
and knock them off balance, right?

08:05.318 --> 08:07.069
- So I think--
- Hey, guys.

08:07.778 --> 08:09.280
I think we should have a talk.

08:12.450 --> 08:14.076
I already told you both no.

08:14.660 --> 08:17.330
If you go back there, you're gonna die.

08:18.623 --> 08:21.626
We understand
why you would be worried about us, Mr. Oh.

08:21.709 --> 08:23.336
Then why don't you listen to me?

08:23.878 --> 08:25.046
To be rebellious?

08:25.546 --> 08:28.132
Uh, Mr. Oh, if I may,

08:28.216 --> 08:29.842
let me tell you what I think about this.

08:31.928 --> 08:33.471
After all the experience we've gathered,

08:33.554 --> 08:35.139
I believe we can fight
Kim Myeong-gil and win.

08:40.645 --> 08:42.939
Yang-jung and Du-yeong are dead.

08:43.689 --> 08:44.815
How can you win?

08:45.399 --> 08:47.985
By following all the instructions
that Mr. Choi gave us.

08:48.819 --> 08:49.654
Uh.

08:50.154 --> 08:52.990
Too many people have had their family
and things they love taken away

08:53.074 --> 08:53.908
by Kim Myeong-gil.

08:53.991 --> 08:57.286
Mr. Choi said
that if we gather those people

08:57.370 --> 08:59.580
and combined our resources
that we'd be sure to win.

09:00.498 --> 09:01.374
Everyone's in hiding

09:01.457 --> 09:03.626
because they know
that they don't stand a chance alone,

09:03.709 --> 09:06.087
but if others like me and Woo-jin
decide to show up,

09:06.170 --> 09:07.755
I'm sure they're gonna want to help us.

09:08.839 --> 09:11.968
What if… Kim Myeong-gil gets to you first?

09:12.051 --> 09:13.886
Oh, you don't have to worry
about the two of us.

09:13.970 --> 09:14.971
Woo-jin has fully healed,

09:15.054 --> 09:18.224
and I've gone up two weight classes,
so my punches are stronger.

09:18.307 --> 09:20.935
We're fully prepared to take him
and his minions down this time.

09:21.018 --> 09:24.605
Between what we've learned
from Mr. Choi, Mr. Lee, and Mr. Hwang,

09:24.689 --> 09:26.274
I'm sure we can beat Kim Myeong-gil.

09:27.692 --> 09:28.526
No.

09:29.193 --> 09:30.486
I won't allow you to.

09:31.654 --> 09:32.780
And that's the end of it.

09:33.864 --> 09:35.575
Mm.

10:13.154 --> 10:16.574
Mr. Oh, I'll be in Rome
by the time you read this letter.

10:18.117 --> 10:20.953
I rented out a small room
with the money Grandpa left me.

10:22.997 --> 10:25.833
I had promised him
that we'd all go to Rome together

10:25.916 --> 10:28.085
after taking down Kim Myeong-gil.

10:28.169 --> 10:29.462
But I ruined everything.

10:31.505 --> 10:33.883
I won't ask you to understand my actions.

10:34.967 --> 10:38.054
But if I stay here,
I'll keep thinking about Grandpa.

10:38.137 --> 10:39.096
and I can't handle that.

10:40.306 --> 10:42.600
Wherever I go, I'm reminded of him,

10:43.684 --> 10:45.186
and I can't stop crying.

10:46.062 --> 10:47.480
It's driving me crazy.

10:49.065 --> 10:51.275
Things will get better
if I'm somewhere far away.

10:52.735 --> 10:53.569
I love you,

10:54.070 --> 10:54.945
and I'm sorry.

11:08.626 --> 11:12.380
- Jesus, it hurts so much.
- What you're feeling isn't pain.

11:13.130 --> 11:15.007
It's the feeling
of weakness leaving your body.

11:15.091 --> 11:16.467
What does that mean?

11:17.593 --> 11:19.637
It means you're gonna emerge
stronger than yesterday.

11:24.183 --> 11:26.227
Guys.

11:26.310 --> 11:27.269
Follow me.

11:30.898 --> 11:31.732
Yes, sir.

11:49.458 --> 11:53.170
This is the last
of Mr. Choi's emergency money.

11:53.963 --> 11:55.005
Take it and go.

11:55.923 --> 11:59.593
I tried to hold you back
because of my fears, and I'm sorry.

12:00.386 --> 12:02.596
I'll book a room and car for you in Seoul.

12:03.472 --> 12:04.473
Don't get hurt.

12:06.434 --> 12:07.268
Thank you

12:08.060 --> 12:09.145
We appreciate it.

12:12.481 --> 12:13.774
We'll win, no matter what.

12:56.108 --> 12:57.193
809.

13:00.571 --> 13:01.697
Oh, here.

13:11.499 --> 13:12.416
Yes?

13:16.921 --> 13:17.880
Yeah, uh, hello.

13:17.963 --> 13:20.674
The two of us were sent here
by Mr. Oh In-muk.

13:29.809 --> 13:30.643
Come in.

13:30.726 --> 13:31.602
Let's go.

13:40.861 --> 13:42.822
Now, if I come back

13:42.905 --> 13:45.491
and find the tape's been torn
or moved at all,

13:45.574 --> 13:47.243
I'll report you to the police.

13:47.743 --> 13:48.828
Uh, why?

13:49.537 --> 13:50.913
My underwear is in there.

13:51.664 --> 13:53.666
- Oh, no, that's not gonna to happen.
- Nuh-uh. Nuh-uh.

13:56.252 --> 13:58.045
There's one bed here and another above.

13:58.128 --> 13:59.755
Who wants the one on top?

13:59.839 --> 14:01.257
- Doesn't matter.
- Yeah.

14:02.007 --> 14:03.384
Then you take the top bunk.

14:03.467 --> 14:04.385
Okay.

14:04.468 --> 14:08.973
Uh, excuse me, sorry, but may I ask
how you came to that decision? Hm?

14:10.349 --> 14:11.433
Just because I can.

14:12.685 --> 14:13.519
Oh.

14:16.063 --> 14:17.940
Uh, here's the key card

14:18.023 --> 14:20.025
and the keys for the car
Grandpa told me to rent.

14:22.361 --> 14:25.197
And here's my number,
but don't call me, please.

14:25.281 --> 14:26.115
I'm busy.

14:26.657 --> 14:28.742
- Okay?
- Yeah.

14:29.535 --> 14:30.369
Cool.

14:38.502 --> 14:39.503
Thank you.

14:39.587 --> 14:40.421
See you.

14:45.467 --> 14:46.385
Hey, wait a sec.

14:46.886 --> 14:49.221
Didn't she just say
that Mr. Oh is her grandpa?

14:49.722 --> 14:51.432
Mm-hm. She did say that.

14:53.767 --> 14:56.770
Ah, they do look alike
now that I think about.

14:56.854 --> 14:59.189
They're both small
and wear glasses.

15:00.441 --> 15:03.277
It seemed like she was forced
to let us stay here.

15:03.360 --> 15:04.486
Yeah, it did.

15:05.905 --> 15:07.031
I feel bad.

15:07.114 --> 15:08.574
Enough of that.

15:09.199 --> 15:11.577
- Let's wash up and strategize.
- Okay.

15:12.953 --> 15:15.414
- My stomach really hurts. Out of the way.
- Whoa, ouch.

15:37.937 --> 15:38.771
YANG JAE-MYEONG

15:38.854 --> 15:39.688
Why him?

15:39.772 --> 15:43.025
Because I think we need to capture
Yang Jae-myeong first to gather intel.

15:43.108 --> 15:44.026
You?

15:46.820 --> 15:48.113
YANG JAE-MYEONG
MR. MOON, PRESIDENT IM

15:48.197 --> 15:50.783
I think we need
to gather our allies first.

15:50.866 --> 15:52.576
We'll be more powerful
if we work together.

15:52.660 --> 15:53.911
That's a good idea.

15:55.704 --> 15:57.289
But how are we going to find this person?

15:57.373 --> 15:58.540
IIL GROUP HEIR

15:58.624 --> 16:00.250
Mr. Choi said he'd be our greatest asset.

16:00.334 --> 16:02.920
I was thinking about it
on the way here.

16:03.003 --> 16:05.172
It won't be easy to get him to meet us.

16:05.255 --> 16:07.132
But I'm gonna try to come up with a plan.

16:07.216 --> 16:08.050
Mm.

16:14.056 --> 16:15.349
- Hey, look!
- Hm?

16:16.976 --> 16:18.268
Whoa!

16:21.355 --> 16:22.940
I think this is a convertible.

16:23.440 --> 16:24.775
- The roof retracts?
- Yes.

16:25.359 --> 16:26.568
It's fabric.

16:36.829 --> 16:37.663
Sir.

16:40.958 --> 16:42.209
There are so many people

16:42.292 --> 16:45.212
who have been screwed over
by Smile Capital just like you.

16:45.295 --> 16:47.715
We're suggesting that we all join forces.

16:47.798 --> 16:52.094
Honestly, the loan sharks in this area
basically all know one another.

16:52.177 --> 16:55.264
If you were to take the lead,
all the others would follow you.

16:58.392 --> 16:59.309
And then what?

16:59.393 --> 17:01.228
You take back your money

17:02.021 --> 17:05.441
and make sure Smile never pulls this shit
with private moneylenders again.

17:06.233 --> 17:08.152
We can obliterate them. Hm?

17:08.235 --> 17:10.654
You've lost a couple hundred million
to them, right?

17:16.702 --> 17:18.078
No, can't do it.

17:18.162 --> 17:19.204
Ah.

17:19.288 --> 17:21.749
If your little plan doesn't work,
I can end up dead.

17:21.832 --> 17:23.417
What about all your money?

17:23.500 --> 17:25.210
Fuck that. It's not worth it, man.

17:26.128 --> 17:27.337
I mean, I can make more.

17:28.338 --> 17:29.882
I'm not getting involved.

17:29.965 --> 17:32.509
You see, I value my life more than money.

17:33.093 --> 17:34.636
- Sir, please--
- Hey.

17:50.486 --> 17:51.820
Hey, what the fuck?

17:53.989 --> 17:54.823
What happened?

17:57.326 --> 17:59.161
Sir? Sir?

18:01.413 --> 18:03.082
Yo, you aren't allowed in here.

18:03.582 --> 18:07.252
Oh, my junior marines!
What are you guys doing here, huh?

18:07.836 --> 18:08.962
Sir, what happened to you?

18:09.797 --> 18:10.631
Huh?

18:11.465 --> 18:13.050
Oh, I uh…

18:13.842 --> 18:14.968
A few days ago,

18:15.469 --> 18:18.472
a bunch of gangsters came in
and took everything I've got.

18:19.681 --> 18:20.599
Why?

18:29.233 --> 18:32.236
I have ten billion won in bonds
that expire within a month.

18:33.195 --> 18:36.573
If you get all of this money back for me,
I'll give you a cut.

18:37.741 --> 18:38.617
Five percent.

18:39.910 --> 18:42.955
This is way too good to pass up.

18:43.497 --> 18:45.040
Then we should sign it now.

18:47.668 --> 18:49.586
An elegant lady like yourself

18:49.670 --> 18:52.214
probably doesn't know
how these things work.

18:52.297 --> 18:54.591
Uh, these matters

18:55.259 --> 19:00.389
require mutual trust, you know,
to come to an agreement.

19:06.687 --> 19:08.021
I'll find someone else then.

19:09.314 --> 19:12.568
- Hm.
- Uh, wait. Wait, wait. Hold on, hold on.

19:12.651 --> 19:15.279
Sometimes we can…

19:15.362 --> 19:16.864
…make exceptions.

19:16.947 --> 19:18.574
Now…

19:22.369 --> 19:23.203
MOON GWANG-MU

19:23.287 --> 19:24.830
I found out later

19:24.913 --> 19:28.333
that in the middle of that contract,
written in the fine print,

19:29.042 --> 19:31.753
it said that if I didn't get these bonds
within the month,

19:31.837 --> 19:34.339
I had to pay for half the entire amount.

19:34.423 --> 19:35.883
Yeah, that was in there.

19:39.136 --> 19:41.930
Definitely sounds like
Smile Capital's way of working.

19:42.556 --> 19:43.849
What the fuck it that?

19:43.932 --> 19:46.226
Its CEO is Kim Myeong-gil.

19:47.603 --> 19:49.771
Kim Myeong-gil who worked for Mr. Choi?

19:50.397 --> 19:51.231
Yes.

19:51.315 --> 19:53.525
Where is that son of a bitch now, huh?

19:54.735 --> 19:57.696
Did you hear about
what happened to Mr. Choi, sir?

19:58.405 --> 19:59.281
What?

19:59.990 --> 20:00.866
I'm sorry, but…

20:03.994 --> 20:05.913
Mr. Choi was killed by Kim Myeong-gil.

20:09.958 --> 20:12.502
Uh, what are you guys talking about?

20:12.586 --> 20:16.298
Kim Myeong-gil killed Mr. Choi, Mr. Hwang,
and Mr. Lee. He killed them all.

20:19.176 --> 20:22.054
We've been lying low in the countryside
with Mr. Oh until till now.

20:22.137 --> 20:25.098
Fuck, stop it guys.
This isn't funny, okay?

20:29.228 --> 20:32.314
I said… I said stop it.

20:32.397 --> 20:34.399
I said stop it. This isn't funny at all!

20:53.502 --> 20:54.336
What?

20:58.465 --> 21:00.008
How could Mr. Choi be dead?

21:01.260 --> 21:02.094
Why?

21:03.804 --> 21:04.846
What do you mean?

21:05.806 --> 21:07.057
Are you saying he's dead?

21:08.725 --> 21:10.852
Come on, fucking answer me, you assholes.

21:10.936 --> 21:11.895
Damn it!

21:11.979 --> 21:12.896
God!

21:15.732 --> 21:17.567
How could Mr. Choi be dead?

21:17.651 --> 21:19.069
Tell me how, huh?

21:34.584 --> 21:36.753
Man, I'm tired.

21:36.837 --> 21:37.963
Oh, I'm exhausted.

21:39.548 --> 21:41.091
Let's get some rest.

21:41.174 --> 21:42.259
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

21:47.055 --> 21:48.056
Who's there?

21:51.351 --> 21:52.561
It's been a while.

21:55.022 --> 21:57.024
- These motherfuckers.
- Ah, shit.

22:02.154 --> 22:03.113
Uh…

22:10.203 --> 22:13.332
Hey, I'll tell you everything.
Just don't hit me, huh?

22:13.915 --> 22:15.917
Word got around amongst the homeless,

22:16.001 --> 22:18.837
so we've been going around
facilities for the disabled to steal IDs.

22:18.920 --> 22:20.756
We weren't asking about you.

22:20.839 --> 22:22.507
What's going on at Smile Capital?

22:23.175 --> 22:26.053
Oh, well, then you should've been
a little more specific.

22:26.136 --> 22:27.929
Has the casino opened, sir?

22:29.931 --> 22:30.766
Wait a sec.

22:31.266 --> 22:32.309
Hey, look down.

22:39.024 --> 22:41.151
Can you maybe try a tough guy act?

22:42.069 --> 22:43.236
How do I do that?

22:43.320 --> 22:45.155
First off, don't be so polite.

22:46.198 --> 22:50.869
Dude, that guy is clearly over 40.
I don't want to talk down to him.

22:52.454 --> 22:53.455
All right, okay.

22:53.538 --> 22:56.166
If he speaks down to you,
punch him in the face.

22:57.292 --> 22:58.210
Mm-hm.

23:02.631 --> 23:06.009
Hey, hard to believe, but I'm actually 31.

23:06.093 --> 23:09.012
And I won't speak down to you guys,
so there's no need for any violence.

23:09.096 --> 23:10.806
My body is a wreck right now.

23:11.348 --> 23:12.307
Not too long ago,

23:12.391 --> 23:14.393
a piece of shit
slashed both of my Achilles heels,

23:14.476 --> 23:16.228
and I spent four months
in physical therapy.

23:16.895 --> 23:18.855
That piece of shit is our friend.
Watch your mouth.

23:20.148 --> 23:23.819
What happened was on me.
I totally deserved all of it.

23:25.362 --> 23:26.363
So, back to the casino?

23:26.988 --> 23:27.906
Yes.

23:27.989 --> 23:30.117
I happened to overhear
the director talking on the phone.

23:30.200 --> 23:32.244
Director? What's his name?

23:32.327 --> 23:33.203
Kim Jun-min, sir.

23:35.622 --> 23:36.456
He's alive?

23:36.540 --> 23:39.167
Some piece of shit slashed his neck
with a knife, and he--

23:41.461 --> 23:45.549
Ah, you're on the same team.

23:45.632 --> 23:48.343
Okay, I understand everything now, 100%.

23:48.844 --> 23:51.513
I'm gonna watch my mouth now,
so there's no need to hit me.

23:52.347 --> 23:53.807
I fucking hate Kim Jun-min.

23:53.890 --> 23:55.434
That guy's a fucking asshole.

23:55.517 --> 23:57.561
Smile Capital's also a bunch
of motherfuckers.

23:57.644 --> 23:59.438
I'm only in it for the money. That's it.

23:59.521 --> 24:02.232
I'll tell you everything. I've been dying
to tell someone about their bullshit.

24:02.315 --> 24:04.609
All right, we get it.
Please get to the point now.

24:04.693 --> 24:06.653
Based on what I heard on the phone,

24:06.736 --> 24:08.864
they're fighting with Iil Group
over the contract,

24:08.947 --> 24:11.700
so Kim Myeong-gil
is really pissed off lately.

24:12.200 --> 24:13.243
And?

24:13.326 --> 24:15.537
Kim Jun-min is tight with this guy,
Im Jang-do.

24:15.620 --> 24:16.621
He's an asshole too.

24:17.122 --> 24:20.000
He was in charge of dealing with the cops,
but he just disappeared one day.

24:20.083 --> 24:23.086
And recently, Kim Myeong-gil was drinking
at a hostess bar,

24:23.170 --> 24:25.881
got into a fight with some dude,
and ended up breaking his wrist.

24:26.465 --> 24:28.800
So the cops were called in,
and it was a whole scene,

24:28.884 --> 24:30.844
but they swept it all under the rug.

24:31.595 --> 24:34.556
That doesn't usually happen
when the police are called to a scene.

24:35.056 --> 24:36.475
So from what Kim Jun-min said,

24:36.558 --> 24:39.227
Kim Myeong-gil has found a guy
to replace Im Jang-do.

24:39.311 --> 24:41.646
Apparently, he hasn't told anyone
about it yet.

24:42.272 --> 24:43.482
Why?

24:43.565 --> 24:45.275
Because he doesn't trust his own men.

24:46.443 --> 24:47.527
And?

24:47.611 --> 24:50.906
And he also plans on taking over
a golf course in Gyeonggi-do.

24:50.989 --> 24:53.450
That's the reason
why we're busting our balls out here.

24:53.533 --> 24:55.785
We get paid shit,
but they practically work us like mules.

24:55.869 --> 24:57.454
Right, guys?

24:58.914 --> 25:01.041
And that concludes my updates for the day.

25:03.877 --> 25:04.711
Hold on.

25:12.552 --> 25:16.014
You know you're fucked
if we send this to Kim Jun-min.

25:16.097 --> 25:17.182
Keep your mouth shut.

25:17.265 --> 25:18.558
No need to worry, sir.

25:19.059 --> 25:21.853
If you need anything else,
feel free to get in touch.

25:21.937 --> 25:24.689
Just like you, I'd like to see
Smile Capital crash and burn.

25:24.773 --> 25:27.943
So do you think you'll be able to get us
the phone number Iil Group's eldest son?

25:28.610 --> 25:30.445
Oh, no, I don't think I can do that.

25:30.987 --> 25:33.740
People like them are pretty serious
about their privacy.

25:34.282 --> 25:35.158
Oh.

25:35.867 --> 25:37.369
IIL GROUP CHAIRMAN'S ELDEST SON

25:41.164 --> 25:42.582
IIL GROUP HEIR
CONFIDENT TO DEVELOP A GLOBAL HOTEL

25:42.666 --> 25:46.419
Oh, his name is Hong Min-beom.
He has the same last name as me.

25:47.170 --> 25:50.674
Bro, this proves that Seoul has
the best jajangmyeon, right?

25:50.757 --> 25:53.426
Yeah.

25:56.930 --> 25:59.349
Why are you using my computer
without permission?

25:59.432 --> 26:01.768
It's logged into all of my messenger apps.

26:01.851 --> 26:04.688
We're so sorry.
We didn't open any messenger apps.

26:05.981 --> 26:07.524
Go to that café next door.

26:07.607 --> 26:09.401
Okay. We're sorry.

26:09.484 --> 26:11.820
- Turn it off.
- Got it.

26:11.903 --> 26:13.321
But how about just this once?

26:13.989 --> 26:15.448
Hurry.

26:15.991 --> 26:16.866
Yeah, that's all.

26:17.450 --> 26:19.035
- Sorry again.
- Ugh.

26:21.830 --> 26:22.747
How did she find out?

26:22.831 --> 26:26.251
Uh, the messenger app must've alerted her
when we turned on the computer.

26:26.334 --> 26:27.168
Mm. Mm.

26:35.218 --> 26:36.428
Whoa!

26:36.511 --> 26:38.138
- Damn. Look.
- What?

26:38.221 --> 26:41.308
Hong Min-beom has 500,000 followers.

26:42.684 --> 26:43.727
Let's see now.

27:02.412 --> 27:04.372
Whoa! Stop, stop, stop, stop!

27:29.147 --> 27:30.023
Didn't I say…

27:32.067 --> 27:35.570
to have the contract ready by today,
so I could spend the money?

27:36.154 --> 27:38.073
I tried my best,

27:39.574 --> 27:40.950
but my father--

27:56.925 --> 27:57.967
Hey, Beom.

28:11.314 --> 28:13.983
Please don't kill me.
Please don't. Please.

28:15.527 --> 28:17.529
Do what I asked you to,

28:17.612 --> 28:19.948
and deliver the contract to me
by this Friday.

28:20.031 --> 28:21.866
If you don't, I'll release the video.

28:21.950 --> 28:25.078
And I will make it look as if
you threw yourself off a building

28:25.161 --> 28:26.371
because of the footage.

28:29.916 --> 28:31.960
Yes. Yes.

29:18.631 --> 29:20.633
Do you want to get rid of Kim Myeong-gil?

29:21.176 --> 29:22.385
We can help you.

29:23.052 --> 29:25.305
What the fuck? Who are these guys?

29:28.600 --> 29:31.770
WE KNOW WHERE THE HARD DRIVE
CONTAINING YOUR FOOTAGE IS LOCATED

29:32.979 --> 29:34.314
Let's just meet them.

29:34.397 --> 29:36.191
We better do it quickly.

29:36.900 --> 29:38.401
The contract is due on Friday.

29:39.235 --> 29:41.070
Then ask if they can meet us now.

29:41.154 --> 29:42.614
What do I do if they say yes?

29:42.697 --> 29:44.199
Have them meet you at the bar you like.

29:44.282 --> 29:46.409
They'll show their true colors
once they drink.

29:47.368 --> 29:49.662
Oh, shit.

29:51.122 --> 29:53.708
Don't worry.
I can get two of my guys to follow you.

30:07.347 --> 30:08.389
Hey, In-seong.

30:08.473 --> 30:09.641
- Yes, sir.
- Tastes good, right?

30:09.724 --> 30:11.059
Oh, yes!

30:11.142 --> 30:12.435
I told you not to drink.

30:13.144 --> 30:14.604
Uh, right.

30:17.357 --> 30:18.608
Come on. They're here.

30:21.277 --> 30:23.863
- Hello, sir. Hello, sir.
- Hello, sir.

30:28.451 --> 30:30.537
Hey, guys. I'm Min-beom's cousin.

30:31.204 --> 30:32.705
Oh, I'm Kim Gun-woo.

30:33.498 --> 30:36.084
And I'm Hong Woo-jin.
I'm the one who sent you the DM.

30:37.877 --> 30:38.711
Have a seat.

30:39.379 --> 30:41.256
Yes, sir.

30:45.677 --> 30:48.847
Let's talk over a few drinks
if you guys don't mind.

30:51.516 --> 30:52.350
Uh…

30:54.727 --> 30:56.187
Uh, I'm really sorry,

30:57.021 --> 30:59.190
but I was attacked and stabbed
by Kim Myeong-gil's men

30:59.274 --> 31:01.985
and they tore my liver, so I can't drink.

31:04.946 --> 31:06.197
If you don't want to drink,

31:07.031 --> 31:08.700
you can just say so, you know?

31:15.164 --> 31:16.165
I’m not lying.

31:16.666 --> 31:18.251
Here, here,

31:19.419 --> 31:20.420
here.

31:22.130 --> 31:23.381
We get it, yeah.

31:23.464 --> 31:25.633
Okay, pull it down.
It’s a disturbing sight.

31:26.134 --> 31:27.719
Why don't you sit this one out?

31:28.720 --> 31:29.637
Were you stabbed too?

31:29.721 --> 31:32.432
Well, actually,
I just don't drink alcohol, sir.

31:35.184 --> 31:37.520
We’re about to talk about serious stuff.
Let's drink.

31:41.399 --> 31:44.694
Well, what is the point
of us meeting here then

31:44.777 --> 31:46.529
if we're not gonna be open
with each other?

31:46.613 --> 31:49.616
How can we trust you
if you back out of something so trivial?

31:50.199 --> 31:51.117
And to be blunt,

31:52.702 --> 31:55.246
you asked to meet up
because you also need us.

32:03.922 --> 32:06.174
- I’m sure I can have just one drink.
- No!

32:06.257 --> 32:08.885
I'll be the one to…
to have a couple drinks with you.

32:12.639 --> 32:13.514
All right.

32:16.559 --> 32:17.393
Min-beom.

32:18.645 --> 32:19.646
All right.

32:25.485 --> 32:26.402
Now, let's drink.

32:29.614 --> 32:30.698
Cheers.

32:31.449 --> 32:32.283
Cheers.

32:40.249 --> 32:43.002
Damn, you're a natural.

32:43.711 --> 32:45.463
Let’s drink from the tall glasses.

32:45.546 --> 32:46.965
These ones are too short.

32:47.048 --> 32:48.549
This is the right way.

32:48.633 --> 32:50.009
- Okay.
- Here.

32:50.510 --> 32:51.636
There we go.

33:41.227 --> 33:42.437
Mm.

33:42.520 --> 33:43.938
Hey, dude. Whoa!

33:44.022 --> 33:45.565
- Slow down.
- Mm-hm.

33:54.741 --> 33:56.701
Much more relaxed now.

34:02.123 --> 34:02.957
Shit.

34:33.738 --> 34:34.697
This is fun.

34:34.781 --> 34:37.116
No, hey, listen to me. Hey, man.

34:37.200 --> 34:38.826
I'm so stressed by that son of a bitch.

34:38.910 --> 34:40.745
I knew you were cool
when you raised your shirt.

34:40.828 --> 34:43.122
- I'm your bro.
- Yeah.

34:43.206 --> 34:45.374
- Yeah, you're my bro. Pour me another.
- Yes, sir!

34:45.458 --> 34:48.586
Because of that stupid asshole…

34:50.046 --> 34:52.632
…I lost so much hair from the stress.

34:53.216 --> 34:55.051
I have hemorrhoids.

34:55.635 --> 34:58.304
Earlier he punched me
before I could even speak.

35:00.473 --> 35:04.227
The police commissioner fucking loves me!

35:04.310 --> 35:06.687
When we're together,
he calls me commissioner.

35:06.771 --> 35:09.232
I'm like, "Hey, bro!
Stop calling me that."

35:09.315 --> 35:11.442
"People are gonna get the wrong idea."

35:13.236 --> 35:16.447
Bro, we have to take care of this kid.

35:16.531 --> 35:18.699
He's family. He's good. He's a good kid.

35:18.783 --> 35:22.203
Woo-jin and Gun-woo,
do whatever the hell you want.

35:22.286 --> 35:25.206
Fuck it, all right.
We've got your back till the end of time.

35:25.289 --> 35:26.541
Should I pour you another, sir?

35:26.624 --> 35:28.292
- I can't drink anymore.
- Okay.

35:28.376 --> 35:29.961
I can't because I have hemorrhoids.

35:30.044 --> 35:32.213
I work too much.

35:32.296 --> 35:34.298
We should keep drinking.

35:54.402 --> 35:55.778
Oh, shit.

36:06.164 --> 36:07.039
Bro.

36:14.881 --> 36:16.174
What the hell?

36:18.509 --> 36:20.011
Oh, good morning, Min-beom.

36:21.888 --> 36:22.847
Did you sleep well?

36:24.974 --> 36:26.434
What's going on?

36:27.977 --> 36:30.188
Uh, you brought us over last night

36:30.271 --> 36:32.315
saying we should have a few more drinks
at your place.

36:32.398 --> 36:33.232
Oh.

36:33.733 --> 36:35.610
We were about to wake you up
for instant noodles.

36:35.693 --> 36:37.111
- To cure the hangover.
- Uh-huh.

36:37.195 --> 36:38.029
Have a seat.

36:39.030 --> 36:40.907
- Gun-woo, take this.
- All right.

36:40.990 --> 36:42.909
- And I can go wake up Gang-yong.
- Okay.

36:42.992 --> 36:44.994
Uh, how much did I drink?

36:49.165 --> 36:49.999
Gun-ho?

36:52.126 --> 36:53.002
Gun-woo.

36:53.085 --> 36:54.003
Oh.

36:55.922 --> 36:57.465
What are we doing?

36:57.548 --> 36:59.425
Oh, Gang-yong is going to communicate

36:59.508 --> 37:01.510
with a computer expert
from the police agency.

37:01.594 --> 37:03.554
That person will hack
Kim Myeong-gil's phone,

37:03.638 --> 37:05.806
and then we'll burn all of the hard drives
in the safe.

37:05.890 --> 37:07.892
The noodles are done.
You should eat, bro.

37:08.392 --> 37:10.144
Gang-yong, get up.

37:11.062 --> 37:12.396
When Kim Myeong-gil goes to Iil Group

37:12.480 --> 37:14.148
to meet you this Friday
to sign a contract,

37:14.232 --> 37:15.399
that's when you're gonna do it.

37:15.483 --> 37:16.359
Who is?

37:18.444 --> 37:19.320
You.

37:21.030 --> 37:22.907
Right. Of course it's me.
Yeah, let's just eat.

37:22.990 --> 37:25.159
How much did I drink?

37:25.243 --> 37:27.703
Whoa! Be careful.

37:30.122 --> 37:32.500
- Oh!
- Ah, nice.

37:32.583 --> 37:33.542
Enjoy.

37:38.673 --> 37:39.674
Mm.

37:40.508 --> 37:42.635
- Thank you for the food.
- Thank you for this meal.

37:49.642 --> 37:51.811
It's been so long
since I had this.

38:00.611 --> 38:02.238
- Whoa.
- Whoa.

38:03.489 --> 38:04.448
It's huge.

38:05.241 --> 38:06.826
It's so tall.

38:06.909 --> 38:08.244
How many stories is this?

38:10.538 --> 38:11.580
Thank you.

38:12.248 --> 38:13.958
- Hello. Hello, sir.
- You're here.

38:14.041 --> 38:15.668
- Hi, everyone
- Hello.

38:15.751 --> 38:16.669
Hi.

38:17.837 --> 38:20.172
- Hello.
- Let me introduce you to my team.

38:23.426 --> 38:24.468
Go ahead.

38:26.012 --> 38:27.221
Detective Yoon Han-gu.

38:27.305 --> 38:28.264
Nice to meet you.

38:30.182 --> 38:31.017
- Hi.
- Hello.

38:31.851 --> 38:34.562
I'm Team Leader Kang Tae-yeong
from Cyber Crimes.

38:34.645 --> 38:37.106
I'm not supposed to be here,
but nice to meet you.

38:37.189 --> 38:38.316
- Oh.
- Oh.

38:39.191 --> 38:42.528
Let's also keep my presence a secret.
We're all here in secret.

38:42.611 --> 38:43.571
Okay.

38:43.654 --> 38:47.241
Anyway, Tae-yeong is the leading
cybersecurity expert in the country.

38:47.325 --> 38:49.285
She'll explain
how to hack Myeong-gil's phone,

38:49.368 --> 38:51.829
and then she'll lead you through the steps
to activate the safe.

38:51.912 --> 38:55.458
Right. There are two ways to do it,
and the first way is to use Wi-Fi, yeah?

38:55.541 --> 38:57.293
So I'll install a jammer
in the meeting room,

38:57.376 --> 39:00.463
and that will temporarily block
Internet access.

39:00.546 --> 39:03.799
That will naturally lead the subject
to reconnect to the Wi-Fi again,

39:03.883 --> 39:05.843
but the moment he connects
to the transmitter I made,

39:05.926 --> 39:07.803
I'll be able to access his phone device.

39:07.887 --> 39:10.097
And once I do, it's game over.

39:10.181 --> 39:11.682
I've also researched
the different safe apps

39:11.766 --> 39:13.267
that he's likely to be using.

39:13.351 --> 39:14.977
As for the second method,

39:15.061 --> 39:18.397
it depends if we can get him
to open up a more direct route for us.

39:18.481 --> 39:20.441
You know how these days
we scan personal QR codes

39:20.524 --> 39:21.776
when entering buildings.

39:21.859 --> 39:23.486
I'll make one to post at the entrance.

39:23.569 --> 39:24.445
ELECTRONIC ACCESS LIST

39:24.528 --> 39:25.404
Then have him scan it.

39:25.488 --> 39:27.031
Once that QR code has been scanned,

39:27.114 --> 39:29.408
it'll open a door
for me to again hack into his phone.

39:29.492 --> 39:31.744
We will be using both methods
at the same time, yeah?

39:32.328 --> 39:33.204
Wait.

39:36.040 --> 39:37.291
What do I have to do?

39:37.375 --> 39:41.462
Uh… you just need to make sure
he stays connected to the Wi-Fi

39:41.545 --> 39:42.797
for as long as possible.

39:42.880 --> 39:45.966
I'll have access to his cloud,
but depending on the size,

39:46.050 --> 39:48.594
it could take some time
to rake all of the data, you know?

39:48.677 --> 39:49.762
If we're lucky,

39:49.845 --> 39:52.890
we may be able to get evidence
for all of his crimes

39:52.973 --> 39:54.350
and catch his accomplices.

39:55.101 --> 39:56.018
Whoa.

39:56.602 --> 39:57.686
But what if…

39:59.688 --> 40:01.148
that bastard catches on?

40:02.066 --> 40:03.442
What's our backup plan?

40:05.694 --> 40:09.198
We're using both methods at once
to avoid needing a backup plan.

40:09.782 --> 40:11.033
Oh, come on, dude.

40:11.617 --> 40:14.120
What is this? Seriously!

40:15.538 --> 40:17.039
No matter what it takes,

40:17.706 --> 40:20.334
we have to destroy
that fucking hard drive tomorrow.

40:21.210 --> 40:23.045
If it was up to me,
I would just take his phone.

40:23.671 --> 40:25.631
Should be easy. Not so complicated.

40:25.714 --> 40:27.716
What's with all the technical details?

40:28.843 --> 40:30.469
Maybe I can take his phone.

40:31.053 --> 40:31.929
Han-gu.

40:35.933 --> 40:39.145
Uh, may I ask what's on the hard drive?

40:39.228 --> 40:40.563
Oh, shit.

40:40.646 --> 40:42.106
You don't need to know.

40:44.024 --> 40:44.859
Got it?

40:45.568 --> 40:46.402
Yeah.

40:50.823 --> 40:52.533
Min-beom, let's get some air.

41:15.347 --> 41:16.849
Min-beom.

41:17.808 --> 41:19.059
You must be nervous.

41:20.186 --> 41:22.229
I know it's a difficult operation.

41:23.105 --> 41:25.399
And, of course,
there are also a lot of limitations.

41:25.483 --> 41:26.775
Bro.

41:28.569 --> 41:31.864
If we don't erase that hard drive,
I'll never be free of Kim Myeong-gil.

41:31.947 --> 41:33.073
I'll be fucked.

41:33.157 --> 41:35.493
That's why I am going to try my hardest.

41:36.118 --> 41:37.620
Please trust me a little more.

41:44.251 --> 41:45.211
I'll try.

42:08.317 --> 42:09.818
Whoa. It's gone.

42:15.824 --> 42:17.117
It's gonna work?

42:17.201 --> 42:18.035
Of course.

42:57.283 --> 42:58.993
Please take your temperature here.

43:01.579 --> 43:03.122
Scan the QR code with your phone.

43:03.622 --> 43:06.208
Shouldn't it be the other way around?

43:06.292 --> 43:08.252
This is how our building does it, Miss.

43:08.961 --> 43:11.547
That's unusual but okay.

43:20.222 --> 43:21.432
So far so good.

43:33.193 --> 43:35.279
- Okay.
- Yes!

43:39.742 --> 43:41.493
Oh.

43:42.453 --> 43:43.537
What's wrong? What?

43:43.621 --> 43:45.831
There's seems to be nothing
in the file folders.

43:45.914 --> 43:46.832
Give me a second.

43:55.883 --> 43:58.927
The, uh, the safe app you had mentioned,
it's not here.

44:02.598 --> 44:04.099
Are you sure the information was right?

44:04.183 --> 44:05.142
Yeah.

44:05.225 --> 44:06.852
Jang-do was not in a position to lie.

44:10.356 --> 44:11.690
Is this asshole onto us?

44:20.366 --> 44:21.492
Oh well.

44:23.160 --> 44:25.537
Director Hong.

44:26.455 --> 44:27.748
How are you?

44:49.520 --> 44:51.438
Oh shit.

44:54.024 --> 44:57.986
- What?
- There's no safe app on his phone.

45:17.965 --> 45:19.341
This fucker has two phones.

45:20.801 --> 45:21.969
What do you mean?

45:22.052 --> 45:23.721
The phone he used
to scan the QR code was black,

45:24.346 --> 45:25.472
but this one's silver.

45:25.556 --> 45:26.765
- Ah.
- Ah.

45:28.642 --> 45:29.476
So what do we do now?

45:29.560 --> 45:31.437
We just need
to get him to connect to the Wi-Fi.

45:41.238 --> 45:43.282
Sir, he's leaving the room.

45:49.037 --> 45:50.038
I'm fine. Don't worry.

45:50.122 --> 45:51.999
- Do you need something? Okay.
- I said I'm fine.

46:00.257 --> 46:01.258
What happened?

46:01.341 --> 46:03.594
Kim Myeong-gil has two phones.

46:03.677 --> 46:05.804
The one we managed to get into
didn't have the safe app.

46:06.597 --> 46:08.640
The phone with the app is in that pouch.

46:09.349 --> 46:10.184
And?

46:11.560 --> 46:13.395
We're still trying to figure out
what to do.

46:13.479 --> 46:16.273
There's not enough time left.
The meeting is wrapping up.

46:19.526 --> 46:21.612
Why don't we talk in private for a second?

46:21.695 --> 46:22.863
Oh, shit.

46:24.239 --> 46:25.783
Tae-yeong, Han-gu.

46:25.866 --> 46:28.076
Could you guys give us
just a minute, please?

46:28.660 --> 46:29.536
Uh, yeah.

46:35.250 --> 46:37.461
Min-beom, what did Im Jang-do use
to take the video?

46:38.295 --> 46:39.213
A cell phone.

46:39.296 --> 46:42.257
Isn't there a chance he would've sent
that video to Kim Myeong-gil's phone?

46:42.341 --> 46:43.842
You mean to get confirmation?

46:43.926 --> 46:44.927
Right.

46:45.010 --> 46:48.430
Before you sign the contract,
instruct him to delete the video first.

46:48.514 --> 46:49.348
Simple as that.

46:49.848 --> 46:52.226
Then Kim Myeong-gil will have no choice
but to take out his phone.

46:52.309 --> 46:53.268
What if he doesn't?

46:53.811 --> 46:55.687
What if he says he didn't receive it?

46:56.814 --> 47:00.150
You should ask him to show you
his entire chat history with Im Jang-do.

47:00.234 --> 47:03.070
And tell him that Im Jang-do said
he was going to send it to him.

47:03.153 --> 47:04.571
You serious?

47:04.655 --> 47:06.782
Criminals like Kim Myeong-gil
trust no one.

47:07.366 --> 47:10.452
In order to check
that Im Jang-do finished the job properly,

47:10.536 --> 47:12.955
he would have asked him
to send the video for proof.

47:21.463 --> 47:22.923
I don't think I can.

47:25.884 --> 47:27.010
You can trust me.

47:27.094 --> 47:28.053
That's not it.

47:29.304 --> 47:31.682
I don't think I have what it takes
to stand up to him.

47:35.435 --> 47:36.520
I'm scared!

47:39.022 --> 47:41.358
Fuck, just looking at him
makes my hands shake!

47:48.323 --> 47:49.157
Min-beom.

47:53.662 --> 47:56.832
Look, you will be able to do this.

47:58.417 --> 48:01.128
I will kick down those doors
at the first sign of trouble.

48:01.628 --> 48:03.881
And if things get out of hand
at any point,

48:05.132 --> 48:07.885
I will use all of our family's resources
to protect you.

48:10.387 --> 48:12.264
So please muster up your courage, okay?

48:18.604 --> 48:21.315
Min-beom, we will barge in there with him.

48:21.982 --> 48:22.900
You can do it.

48:43.837 --> 48:45.797
You sure kept us waiting, didn't you?

48:46.632 --> 48:47.674
What were you doing?

48:48.926 --> 48:50.636
Could the lawyers please step out?

48:51.637 --> 48:53.430
I need a moment in private with Mr. Kim.

48:54.139 --> 48:55.057
Okay.

49:08.987 --> 49:10.739
I'm sure you don't want to be arrested.

49:18.121 --> 49:21.458
What's with… this bravado?

49:21.959 --> 49:23.126
Erase the video

49:24.336 --> 49:25.837
before we sign the contract.

49:28.048 --> 49:29.007
It's not here.

49:30.801 --> 49:32.761
I'll delete it as soon as I get home.

49:32.844 --> 49:33.845
You have my word.

49:35.806 --> 49:36.932
Don't bother lying.

49:38.183 --> 49:40.602
I know that your guy sent it
to your phone.

49:44.022 --> 49:45.565
I want to see you delete it.

50:23.311 --> 50:24.980
- I'll do it now.
- No.

50:26.273 --> 50:28.025
I'm going to delete it myself.

50:29.026 --> 50:29.943
I don't trust you.

50:31.653 --> 50:32.696
And if I refuse?

50:33.947 --> 50:35.741
Then I'm not signing.

50:37.200 --> 50:38.368
You must be crazy.

50:40.495 --> 50:41.329
Well…

50:43.373 --> 50:46.251
You think my family will sit still
if you lay a finger on me?

50:47.252 --> 50:48.795
I've been so embarrassed,

50:49.755 --> 50:52.257
so I've been trying to take care of this
on my own.

50:53.633 --> 50:57.095
But… my aunt runs the tax department.

50:57.179 --> 50:58.472
One phone call from me,

50:58.555 --> 51:01.016
and within 24 hours,
your company will be audited.

51:01.099 --> 51:01.933
So,

51:02.893 --> 51:04.728
you want to pay tens of billions in taxes?

51:04.811 --> 51:06.563
You want to go there? Huh?

51:14.571 --> 51:15.989
You've become more eloquent.

51:17.866 --> 51:19.242
At least with your threats.

51:20.118 --> 51:21.078
I learned from you.

51:25.415 --> 51:26.374
I like it.

51:29.544 --> 51:30.420
Well, I don't.

51:49.940 --> 51:50.982
WI-FI OFF

51:51.066 --> 51:52.776
WI-FI ON

51:56.404 --> 51:57.364
We're in.

51:58.532 --> 51:59.616
Okay, give me a second.

52:05.413 --> 52:06.331
Ah!

52:06.414 --> 52:07.415
The safe app.

52:07.499 --> 52:08.333
It is here.

52:08.416 --> 52:09.709
- Yes!
- Hell yeah!

52:09.793 --> 52:11.378
- Okay
- Shh!

52:11.461 --> 52:13.380
All right, I will break in now, okay?

52:19.970 --> 52:21.847
Will that be all, Mr. Hong?

52:23.598 --> 52:24.641
Now we can sign.

52:35.694 --> 52:38.446
Okay. Should I go ahead with it now?

52:50.041 --> 52:51.126
Do it.

52:51.209 --> 52:52.210
Okay.

52:57.048 --> 52:58.383
TOTAL INCINERATION IN PROCESS

53:11.438 --> 53:12.272
It's done.

53:12.355 --> 53:13.565
Yes.

53:13.648 --> 53:16.443
- Hey, are you 100% sure that it worked?
- Yes, definitely.

53:16.985 --> 53:19.738
- Oh, thank you.
- I'll extract all of the data right now.

53:19.821 --> 53:21.781
Okay, yeah, extract it. Extract it all.

53:24.159 --> 53:25.368
This is all thanks to you two.

53:25.452 --> 53:27.078
- Oh, not at all.
- Not at all.

53:27.162 --> 53:28.663
We'll gather all the evidence
on that phone,

53:28.747 --> 53:31.708
and that bastard Kim Myeong-gil
will end up behind bars, so don't worry.

53:31.791 --> 53:32.918
- Great.
- Great.

53:42.427 --> 53:45.180
Thanks for your hard work.
Gang-yong will be in touch.

53:45.263 --> 53:47.098
- Okay, thank you.
- Thank you.

53:47.599 --> 53:49.809
There's something
I've been thinking about.

53:50.644 --> 53:52.312
Your wound, your scars.

53:53.396 --> 53:55.023
I'd like to help you get treatment for it.

53:55.106 --> 53:57.901
Oh, I really appreciate it,

53:58.777 --> 54:00.487
but I'm okay.

54:01.154 --> 54:02.030
Are you sure?

54:02.113 --> 54:02.948
Yes.

54:03.031 --> 54:08.036
Thanks to this scar,
I was able to meet some amazing people,

54:08.119 --> 54:11.248
and it gave me the strength to carry on
instead of giving up.

54:12.290 --> 54:14.709
So I…

54:14.793 --> 54:16.211
I'm okay with my scars.

54:17.045 --> 54:17.963
I understand.

54:19.172 --> 54:20.090
I'll see you guys soon.

54:20.173 --> 54:21.800
- Okay.
- Okay.

54:22.801 --> 54:23.760
Please walk them out.

54:23.843 --> 54:25.053
- Yes, sir.
- I'll say bye here.

54:25.136 --> 54:27.597
- Okay, thank you.
- Bye. Thank you.

54:30.976 --> 54:33.061
- Thank god it ended well.
- I know, right?

54:35.897 --> 54:37.857
- I knew things would go well.
- Uh-huh.

54:40.402 --> 54:42.153
- Oh, and Gun-woo.
- Hm?

54:42.237 --> 54:46.491
Do you remember when Mr. Choi asked
Im Jang-do about the gold bars?

54:47.534 --> 54:50.453
Yeah, uh, about how
only In-beom knows where they are.

54:51.079 --> 54:53.164
Yeah. How much do you think it's worth?

54:54.082 --> 54:55.667
I don't know.

54:56.918 --> 54:59.421
My guess is
somewhere around tens of billions.

55:00.588 --> 55:01.464
Wow.

55:03.300 --> 55:05.969
That includes the money
he stole from Mr. Choi, right?

55:06.052 --> 55:06.886
Right.

55:07.637 --> 55:09.973
If the cops let Kim Myeong-gil
slip away again,

55:10.974 --> 55:12.684
he's gonna take the money and gold

55:13.852 --> 55:15.145
and leave the country.

55:16.104 --> 55:19.149
We can't let that happen.
That money belongs to Mr. Choi.

55:19.649 --> 55:20.608
Let's get ready.

55:21.151 --> 55:23.820
Let's chase him down to the end
and maul him to death.

55:23.903 --> 55:25.030
I'm in.

55:32.996 --> 55:35.123
- Yes, sir!
- Woo!

55:35.206 --> 55:38.335
- Beom, Jun-min, good work, you guys!
- Sir!

55:38.418 --> 55:41.379
Man, let's go for round two at my place.

55:44.299 --> 55:45.425
Woo! We're here.

55:45.508 --> 55:47.052
Don't you smell something?

55:49.137 --> 55:51.431
Hm, it does kind of smell like smoke.

55:54.392 --> 55:55.435
Quiet.

55:59.481 --> 56:00.315
Don't.

56:18.208 --> 56:20.377
Fucker!

56:26.549 --> 56:27.509
Go.

56:37.811 --> 56:39.979
CHOI TAE-HO

56:58.289 --> 57:00.708
- Where are you?
- Working overtime, sir.

57:01.418 --> 57:03.920
I'll send a driver
with a phone over right now.

57:04.462 --> 57:06.005
I need you to find someone.

57:06.089 --> 57:09.092
- How many people?
- For now, just an old man.

57:09.676 --> 57:10.552
How urgent is this?

57:10.635 --> 57:12.512
If you find him by tomorrow at noon,

57:13.430 --> 57:14.681
I'll pay you triple.

57:16.516 --> 57:17.767
All right, sir.

57:17.851 --> 57:22.730
SERIOUS CRIME INVESTIGATION
DIVISION UNIT 1
